  "In northern France there is a village called simply Y.",
  "Over Venezuela's Lake Maracaibo, lightning flashes on well over 100 nights a year, earning it the title of lightning capital of the world.",
  "Cherrapunji in India once got more than 26 metres of rain in just 12 months, in 1860 and 1861.",
