  "The Sargasso Sea in the Atlantic is the only sea with no coastline at all; it is bounded by ocean currents.",
  "If Mount Everest were dropped into the Mariana Trench, its peak would still be about 2 km underwater.",
  "The Pacific Ocean is larger than all of Earth's land put together.",
  "China and Russia each share land borders with 14 countries, more than any other nation.",
  "France's longest land border is with Brazil, thanks to French Guiana in South America.",
  "Parts of Mexico City are sinking by tens of centimetres a year as water is pumped from beneath it.",
  "Amsterdam's Royal Palace stands on 13,659 wooden piles driven into the soggy ground.",
  "The tiny Pacific nation of Tuvalu earns a meaningful share of its income from leasing its internet domain, .tv.",
  "In Utqiaġvik, Alaska, the sun stays below the horizon for about two months every winter.",
  "Each summer, Spotted Lake in British Columbia dries into hundreds of colourful mineral pools, like polka dots.",
