  "Boring in Oregon and Dull in Scotland are officially paired as sister communities.",
  "Japan has more than 14,000 islands, a count that roughly doubled in 2023 after a recount using modern maps.",
  "At its narrowest, the Strait of Gibraltar separates Europe from Africa by only about 14 km.",
  "Kazakhstan is the largest landlocked country in the world, bigger than all of Western Europe.",
  "Ecuador is named after the equator, which runs just north of its capital, Quito.",
  "The world's first webcam watched a coffee pot at Cambridge University's computer lab, so researchers could see if it was empty before walking over.",
  "Bubble Wrap was invented in 1957 as a textured wallpaper. It flopped as decor and found its true calling as packaging.",
  "Play-Doh began life as a putty for cleaning soot off wallpaper, before being reinvented as a children's toy in the 1950s.",
  "The Slinky was invented by a naval engineer who watched a torsion spring tumble off a shelf and keep 'walking'.",
