  "Super Glue was first discovered in 1942 by a chemist trying to make clear plastic gun sights. It was rejected for being far too sticky.",
  "The Etch A Sketch was invented in France, where it was called 'L'Écran Magique', the magic screen.",
  "Mr. Potato Head was the first toy ever advertised on television, in 1952. Early kits came without a body: you stuck the parts into a real potato.",
